[["Map",1,2,68,69],"blog",["Map",3,4,24,25,44,45],"second-post",{"id":3,"data":5,"body":10,"filePath":11,"assetImports":12,"digest":14,"rendered":15},{"title":6,"description":7,"pubDate":8,"heroImage":9},"Second post","Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet",["Date","2026-07-15T04:00:00.000Z"],"__ASTRO_IMAGE_../../assets/blog-placeholder-4.jpg","Text here later. I'm not sure when this will get updates but hopefully very soon.","src/content/blog/second-post.md",[13],"../../assets/blog-placeholder-4.jpg","2230e32fe793a666",{"html":16,"metadata":17},"\u003Cp>Text here later. I’m not sure when this will get updates but hopefully very soon.\u003C/p>\n",{"headings":18,"localImagePaths":19,"remoteImagePaths":20,"frontmatter":21,"imagePaths":23},[],[],[],{"title":6,"description":7,"pubDate":22,"heroImage":13},"Jul 15 2026",[],"third-post",{"id":24,"data":26,"body":30,"filePath":31,"assetImports":32,"digest":34,"rendered":35},{"title":27,"description":7,"pubDate":28,"heroImage":29},"Third post",["Date","2026-07-22T04:00:00.000Z"],"__ASTRO_IMAGE_../../assets/blog-placeholder-2.jpg","Article here later.","src/content/blog/third-post.md",[33],"../../assets/blog-placeholder-2.jpg","7dd83ea9683f6389",{"html":36,"metadata":37},"\u003Cp>Article here later.\u003C/p>\n",{"headings":38,"localImagePaths":39,"remoteImagePaths":40,"frontmatter":41,"imagePaths":43},[],[],[],{"title":27,"description":7,"pubDate":42,"heroImage":33},"Jul 22 2026",[],"why-a-static-site",{"id":44,"data":46,"body":50,"filePath":51,"assetImports":52,"digest":54,"rendered":55},{"title":47,"description":7,"pubDate":48,"heroImage":49},"Why A Static Site",["Date","2026-08-04T04:00:00.000Z"],"__ASTRO_IMAGE_../../assets/Astro Site.png","#### The Return of Fast Web Development: \r\n\r\nModern web development pushed heavily toward Client-Side Rendering (CSR) and heavy single-page application (SPA) frameworks. While tools like React, Vue, and Angular made web applications interactive, they often introduced massive JavaScript bundles, sluggish load times, and poor search engine optimization (SEO) out of the box.  Static Site Generators (SSGs) flipped this model by pre-rendering pages into pure HTML, CSS, and minimal JavaScript during the build process. Astro has emerged as one of the most effective web frameworks for content-driven websites, offering remarkable speed without sacrificing modern developer tools.","src/content/blog/why-a-static-site.md",[53],"../../assets/Astro Site.png","fe004dd434dcca25",{"html":56,"metadata":57},"\u003Ch4 id=\"the-return-of-fast-web-development\">The Return of Fast Web Development:\u003C/h4>\n\u003Cp>Modern web development pushed heavily toward Client-Side Rendering (CSR) and heavy single-page application (SPA) frameworks. While tools like React, Vue, and Angular made web applications interactive, they often introduced massive JavaScript bundles, sluggish load times, and poor search engine optimization (SEO) out of the box.  Static Site Generators (SSGs) flipped this model by pre-rendering pages into pure HTML, CSS, and minimal JavaScript during the build process. Astro has emerged as one of the most effective web frameworks for content-driven websites, offering remarkable speed without sacrificing modern developer tools.\u003C/p>\n",{"headings":58,"localImagePaths":63,"remoteImagePaths":64,"frontmatter":65,"imagePaths":67},[59],{"depth":60,"slug":61,"text":62},4,"the-return-of-fast-web-development","The Return of Fast Web Development:",[],[],{"title":47,"description":7,"pubDate":66,"heroImage":53},"Aug 04 2026",[],"meta::meta",["Map",70,71,72,73,74,75],"astro-config-digest","{\"root\":{},\"srcDir\":{},\"publicDir\":{},\"outDir\":{},\"cacheDir\":{},\"site\":\"https://pchuber.github.io\",\"compressHTML\":\"jsx\",\"base\":\"/astro\",\"trailingSlash\":\"ignore\",\"output\":\"static\",\"scopedStyleStrategy\":\"attribute\",\"build\":{\"format\":\"directory\",\"client\":{},\"server\":{},\"assets\":\"_astro\",\"serverEntry\":\"entry.mjs\",\"redirects\":true,\"inlineSt